{"version":1,"content":"<p>APEC財長會議今日（20日）在港舉行。</p><p>特首李家超表示，會議屬下個月APEC領導人非正式會議在深圳召開之前，最後一個專業部長級會議，對於香港發揮金融優勢，服務APEC中國年的意義重大。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.760675+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:35:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T17:17:37.903569+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684168+00:00","content_hash":"dd77b8b6bef1ff29fa523e87510896e67f5550259b696428bc2293558a508d67","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}